<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA SLIGHTLY LOWER AT SHARE PRICE FIX.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA SLIGHTLY LOWER AT SHARE PRICE FIX.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading share Unibanka slipped</p>
<p>four santimes to 4.84 lats at the morning share price fix on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bank earlier announced that it has cancelled its planned</p>
<p>merger with fellow commercial bank Zemes Banka.</p>
<p>It and other Latvian shares registered the following prices</p>
<p>after the morning trade session on Friday.</p>
